# Ash Phoenix Forms

## Section

```elixir
alias Smalltalk.Conversations.Conversation

```

```elixir
IEx.Helpers.recompile()

form =
  Conversation
  |> AshPhoenix.FilterForm.new()
  |> AshPhoenix.FilterForm.add_predicate(:type, :in, [])
  |> AshPhoenix.FilterForm.add_predicate(:is_admin?, :eq, false)
  |> Phoenix.Component.to_form()

